OL,3,GNEWSADelayed pet cremation service to
OL,4,Aopen in November
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pet cremation service at an East
OL,7,FYorkshire cemetery is due to launch in
OL,8,FNovember after being delayed.
OL,10,FConstruction work started at Priory
OL,11,FWoods Cemetery in Cottingham in
OL,12,FFebruary this year.
OL,14,FThe service was supposed to launch in
OL,15,Fthe spring, but issues fitting the pet
OL,16,Fcremator pushed back the timetable.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
