OL,3,GNEWSADelayed pet cremation service to
OL,4,Aopen in November
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hull City Council spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"We experienced some unexpected issues
OL,8,Fwith the installation of our new pet
OL,9,Fcremator. These have now been resolved
OL,10,Fand we now expect to open the new
OL,11,Ffacility in November."
